developer  so the average salary of a web developer  in india is around 3 lakhs 90 000 rupees  per annum  the average salary of a web developer in  the united states is around 68 000  dollars per annum  the average salary of a web designer in  india is around three lakh sixty  thousand rupees per annum  while the average salary of a web  designer in the united states is around  fifty three thousand us dollars per  annum so  moving to the most important question  which one should you choose  it is really a matter of preference  if you have a creative bent of mind and  enjoy using good looking web and mobile  applications and also enjoy designing  them then i would suggest you go for a  web or ux designer role if you have a  technical background like java or python  and you're interested in bringing the  designs to life i would suggest you go  for a web developer role so this brings  us to the end of this full course  i hope it was useful and interesting  if you enjoyed this video please  subscribe to the simply learn channel  thank you and keep learning  you
 

